<!--
  Synthetic ISO 20022 auth.106 EMIR reconciliation fixture for OpenDQI.
  Hand-authored — not derived from any ESMA or SWIFT example.

  Exercises the three EMIR reconciliation checks:
   1. PAIRED + RECONCILED → no issue.
   2. UNPAIRED → EMIR.REC.UNPAIRED_TRADE.
   3. PAIRED + UNRECONCILED + 2 mismatched fields →
      EMIR.REC.UNRECONCILED_TRADE + 2 × EMIR.REC.FIELD_MISMATCH.
-->
